{"id":"02358e8c320b1ace","group":"73","path":"73/73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph.md","title":"3-CNF 的文字出现图","display":"df-three-sat-occurrence-graph — 3-CNF 的文字出现图","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)","book_abbrev":"73","label":"73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph","aliases":["73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph"],"display":"df-three-sat-occurrence-graph — 3-CNF 的文字出现图","depends_on":["[[73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas]]","[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]"],"source_id":"HMU2007","source_ref":"§10.4.2, Theorem 10.18 construction, print pp. 460–462; PDF pp. 482–484; at-most-three extension","source_status":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note","reviewed_on":"2026-10-24","revision_round":"pdf-third-edition-20261024","edition_role":"third-edition-core","third_edition_chapter":10},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Introduction to Automata Theory, Languages, and Computation (Hopcroft, Motwani, Ullman; 3rd ed., 2007)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"73"},{"key":"label","html":"73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-three-sat-occurrence-graph — 3-CNF 的文字出现图"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"88dea30e48fadc7f\" href=\"?note=88dea30e48fadc7f\" title=\"73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas\">73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"4f6d4d247465f3c9\" href=\"?note=4f6d4d247465f3c9\" title=\"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding\">73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HMU2007"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"§10.4.2, Theorem 10.18 construction, print pp. 460–462; PDF pp. 482–484; at-most-three extension"},{"key":"source_status","html":"source-statement-checked; local-formalization; proof-outline-in-note"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"third-edition-core"},{"key":"third_edition_chapter","html":"10"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbf C\\in(\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\le3})^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathbf C\\in(\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\le3})^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为非空子句的有限列表，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m=|\\mathbf C|\">\\(m=|\\mathbf C|\\)</span>。文字 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell,r\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\">\\(\\ell,r\\in\\mathsf{Lit}\\)</span>，变量集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Var}\">\\(\\mathsf{Var}\\)</span> 采用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"88dea30e48fadc7f\" href=\"?note=88dea30e48fadc7f\" title=\"73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas\">73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas</a> 的布尔语法。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Opp}(\\ell,r)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\;[(\\ell=p\\land r=\\neg p)\\lor(\\ell=\\neg p\\land r=p)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Opp}(\\ell,r)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\;[(\\ell=p\\land r=\\neg p)\\lor(\\ell=\\neg p\\land r=p)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"O_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in\\mathbb N^2:0\\le i&lt;m\\land0\\le j&lt;|\\mathbf C(i)|\\},\\qquad\nN_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{m-1}|\\mathbf C(i)|,\\qquad\nv:O_{\\mathbf C}\\to V_{N_{\\mathbf C}},\\qquad v(i,j)\\coloneqq j+\\sum_{h=0}^{i-1}|\\mathbf C(h)|\\quad((i,j)\\in O_{\\mathbf C}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[O_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in\\mathbb N^2:0\\le i&lt;m\\land0\\le j&lt;|\\mathbf C(i)|\\},\\qquad\nN_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{m-1}|\\mathbf C(i)|,\\qquad\nv:O_{\\mathbf C}\\to V_{N_{\\mathbf C}},\\qquad v(i,j)\\coloneqq j+\\sum_{h=0}^{i-1}|\\mathbf C(h)|\\quad((i,j)\\in O_{\\mathbf C}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"E_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\{\\{v(i,j),v(h,k)\\}:(i,j),(h,k)\\in O_{\\mathbf C}\\land\n(i,j)\\ne(h,k)\\land[i=h\\lor\\operatorname{Opp}(\\mathbf C(i)(j),\\mathbf C(h)(k))]\\},\\qquad\nG_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq(N_{\\mathbf C},E_{\\mathbf C}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[E_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\{\\{v(i,j),v(h,k)\\}:(i,j),(h,k)\\in O_{\\mathbf C}\\land\n(i,j)\\ne(h,k)\\land[i=h\\lor\\operatorname{Opp}(\\mathbf C(i)(j),\\mathbf C(h)(k))]\\},\\qquad\nG_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq(N_{\\mathbf C},E_{\\mathbf C}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>每个出现位置对应独立顶点；同一个文字出现多次也不能合并。每个子句内两两相连，互补文字之间也相连。空合取 m=0 时顶点数为零，不产生错误索引。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"88dea30e48fadc7f","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding","status":"resolved","id":"4f6d4d247465f3c9","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-finite-graph-binary-coding]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas","status":"resolved","id":"88dea30e48fadc7f","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathbf C\\in(\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\le3})^{<\\omega}$ 为非空子句的有限列表，$m=|\\mathbf C|$。文字 $\\ell,r\\in\\mathsf{Lit}$，变量集 $\\mathsf{Var}$ 采用 [[73-df-bounded-clause-boolean-formulas]] 的布尔语法。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathbf C\\in(\\mathsf{Clause}_{\\le3})^{<\\omega}","display":false},{"tex":"m=|\\mathbf C|","display":false},{"tex":"\\ell,r\\in\\mathsf{Lit}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Var}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Opp}(\\ell,r)\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists p\\in\\mathsf{Var}\\;[(\\ell=p\\land r=\\neg p)\\lor(\\ell=\\neg p\\land r=p)].","display":true},{"tex":"O_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\{(i,j)\\in\\mathbb N^2:0\\le i<m\\land0\\le j<|\\mathbf C(i)|\\},\\qquad\nN_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\sum_{i=0}^{m-1}|\\mathbf C(i)|,\\qquad\nv:O_{\\mathbf C}\\to V_{N_{\\mathbf C}},\\qquad v(i,j)\\coloneqq j+\\sum_{h=0}^{i-1}|\\mathbf C(h)|\\quad((i,j)\\in O_{\\mathbf C}).","display":true},{"tex":"E_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq\\{\\{v(i,j),v(h,k)\\}:(i,j),(h,k)\\in O_{\\mathbf C}\\land\n(i,j)\\ne(h,k)\\land[i=h\\lor\\operatorname{Opp}(\\mathbf C(i)(j),\\mathbf C(h)(k))]\\},\\qquad\nG_{\\mathbf C}\\coloneqq(N_{\\mathbf C},E_{\\mathbf C}).","display":true}],"bytes":1920,"backlinks":[{"id":"6af52783a9bce985","anchor":"ref-266","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph|3-CNF 的文字出现图]] （本轮新建）"},{"id":"5473eb1b238df94f","anchor":"ref-4","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathbf C,m,N_{\\mathbf C},E_{\\mathbf C}$ 见 [[73-df-three-sat-occurrence-graph]]；布尔式 $\\varphi_{\\mathbf C}$ 在下式构造。"}],"outgoing":["88dea30e48fadc7f","4f6d4d247465f3c9"]}